{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-gen-3-1","title":"Genesis 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The serpent deceives Eve. 6 Both she and Adam transgress the divine command, and fall into sin and misery. 8 God arraigns them. 14 The serpent is cursed. 15 The promised seed. 16 The punishment of mankind. 21 Their first clothing. 22 Their expulsion from paradise.</p>\n<p>Now. 13-15; Isa 27:1; Mt 10:16; 2Co 11:3,14; Re 12:9; 20:2 serpent.The Samaritan Copy, instead of {nachash,} \"a serpent,\" reads {cachash,} \"a liar or deceiver,\" read Joh 8:44.</p>\n<p>he said. Nu 22:28,29; Ec 4:10; 1Pe 3:7 Yea, hath. Heb. Yea, because, etc. hath. Mt 4:3,6,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-2","title":"Genesis 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>serpent. Ps 58:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-3","title":"Genesis 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>But. 2:16,17 touch. 20:6; Ex 19:12,13; 1Ch 16:22; Job 1:11; 2:5; 19:21; 1Co 7:1; 2Co 6:17 Col 2:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-4","title":"Genesis 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>serpent. Joh 8:44 Ye. 13; De 29:19; 2Ki 1:4,6,16; 8:10; Ps 10:11; 2Co 2:11; 11:3; 1Ti 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-5","title":"Genesis 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>God. Ex 20:7; 1Ki 22:6; Jer 14:13,14; 28:2,3; Eze 13:2-6,22; 2Co 11:3 2Co 11:13-15 your. 7,10; Mt 6:23; Ac 26:18 as gods. Ex 5:2; 2Ch 32:15; Ps 12:4; Eze 28:2,9; 29:3; Da 4:30; 6:7 Ac 12:22,23; 2Co 4:4; 2Th 2:4; Re 13:4,14 knowing. 22; 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-6","title":"Genesis 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>saw. Jos 7:21; Jud 16:1,2 pleasant. Heb. a desire. Eze 24:16,21,25 to the eyes. 6:2; 39:7; Jos 7:21; 2Sa 11:2; Job 31:1; Mt 5:28; 1Jo 2:16 and did. 1Ti 2:14 and he did eat. 12,17; Ho 6:7; *marg: Ro 5:12-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-7","title":"Genesis 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>And the. 5; De 28:34; 2Ki 6:20; Lu 16:23 knew. 10,11; 2:25 and they. Job 9:29-31; Isa 28:20; 59:6 aprons. or, things to gird about.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-8","title":"Genesis 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>And they. 10; De 4:33; 5:25 cool of the day. Heb. wind. Job 34:21,22; 38:1 hid. Job 22:14; 31:33; 34:22; Ps 139:1-12; Pr 15:3; Jer 23:24; Am 9:2,3 Jon 1:3,9,10; Ro 2:15; Heb 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-9","title":"Genesis 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>4:9; 11:5; 16:8; 18:20,21; Jos 7:17-19; Re 20:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-10","title":"Genesis 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>and I was. 2:25; Ex 3:6; Job 23:15; Ps 119:120; Isa 33:14; 57:11; 1Jo 3:20 because. 7; 2:25; Ex 32:25; Isa 47:3; Re 3:17,18; 16:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-11","title":"Genesis 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>4:10; Ps 50:21; Ro 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-12","title":"Genesis 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>2:18,20,22; Ex 32:21-24; 1Sa 15:20-24; Job 31:33; Pr 19:3; 28:13 Lu 10:29; Ro 10:3; Jas 1:13-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-13","title":"Genesis 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>What. 4:10-12; 44:15; 1Sa 13:11; 2Sa 3:24; 12:9-12; Joh 18:35 The serpent. 4-6; 2Co 11:3; 1Ti 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-14","title":"Genesis 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>thou art. 1; 9:6; Ex 21:28-32; Le 20:25 dust. Ps 72:9; Isa 29:4; 65:25; Mic 7:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-15","title":"Genesis 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>enmity. Nu 21:6,7; Am 9:3; Mr 16:18; Lu 10:19; Ac 28:3-6; Ro 3:13 thy seed. Mt 3:7; 12:34; 13:38; 23:33; Joh 8:44; Ac 13:10; 1Jo 3:8,10 her seed. Ps 132:11; Isa 7:14; Jer 31:22; Mic 5:3; Mt 1:23,25; Lu 1:31-35,76 Ga 4:4 it shall. Ro 16:20; Eph 4:8; Col 2:15; Heb 2:14,15; 1Jo 3:8; 5:5; Re 12:7,8,17 Re 20:1-3,10 thou. 49:17; Isa 53:3,4,12; Da 9:26; Mt 4:1-10; Lu 22:39-44,53 Joh 12:31-33; 14:30,31; Heb 2:18; 5:7; Re 2:10; 12:9-13; 13:7; 15:1-6 Re 20:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-16","title":"Genesis 3:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>in sorrow. 35:16-18; 1Sa 4:19-21; Ps 48:6; Isa 13:8; 21:3; 26:17,18; 53:11 Jer 4:31; 6:24; 13:21; 22:23; 49:24; Mic 4:9,10; Joh 16:21; 1Th 5:3 1Ti 2:15 thy desire. 4:7 to. or, subject to. rule. Nu 30:7,8,13; Es 1:20; 1Co 7:4; 11:3; 14:34; Eph 5:22-24; Col 3:18 1Ti 2:11,12; Tit 2:5; 1Pe 3:1-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-17","title":"Genesis 3:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Because. 1Sa 15:23,24; Mt 22:12; 25:26,27,45; Lu 19:22; Ro 3:19 and hast. 6,11; 2:16,17; Jer 7:23,24 cursed. 5:29; Ps 127:2; Ec 1:2,3,13,14; 2:11,17; Isa 24:5,6; Ro 8:20-22 in sorrow. Job 5:6,7; 14:1; 21:17; Ps 90:7-9; Ec 2:22,23; 5:17; Joh 16:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-18","title":"Genesis 3:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Thorns. Jos 23:13; Job 5:5; 31:40; Pr 22:5; 24:31; Isa 5:6; 7:23; 32:13 Jer 4:3; 12:13; Mt 13:7; Heb 6:8 bring forth. Heb. cause to bud. herb. Job 1:21; Ps 90:3; 104:2,14,15; Ro 14:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-19","title":"Genesis 3:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>In. Ec 1:3,13; Eph 4:28; 1Th 2:9; 2Th 3:10 till. Job 1:21; Ps 90:3; 104:29; Ec 5:15 for dust. 2:7; 18:27 and. 23:4; Job 17:13-16; 19:26; 21:26; 34:15; Ps 22:15,29; 104:29 Pr 21:16; Ec 3:20; 12:7; Da 12:2; Ro 5:12-21; 1Co 15:21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-20","title":"Genesis 3:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Adam. 2:20,23; 5:29; 16:11; 29:32-35; 35:18; Ex 2:10; 1Sa 1:20; Mt 1:21,23 Eve. Heb. Chavah; that is, living. of. Ac 17:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-21","title":"Genesis 3:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>make. 7; Isa 61:10; Ro 3:22; 2Co 5:2,3,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-22","title":"Genesis 3:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>as one. 5; 1:26; 11:6,7; Isa 19:12,13; 47:12,13; Jer 22:23 tree. 2:9; Pr 3:18; Re 2:7; 22:2 eat. Ps 22:26; Joh 6:48-58</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-23","title":"Genesis 3:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>till. 19; 2:5; 4:2,12; 9:20; Ec 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-3-24","title":"Genesis 3:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>east. 2:8 Cherubims. Ex 25:2,20,22; 1Sa 4:4; 1Ki 6:25-35; Ps 80:1; 99:1; 104:4 Eze 10:2-22; Heb 1:7 a flaming. Nu 22:23; Jos 5:13; 1Ch 21:16,17; Heb 1:7 to keep. Joh 14:6; Heb 10:18-22</p>"}]}